codex
The semantics now compiles cleanly with the Haskell backend. Its input sort excludes the undefined empty-list case, and the universal claim ranges over that entire non-empty inductive domain; I’ve also kept both prompt examples as concrete proof claims so parser/evaluator regressions cannot hide behind the symbolic theorem.
